{"checkIfIsAvailable computes end from the slot start ignoring event length and uses find() to reject a slot if it is outside any single working-hours range, which breaks users with multiple working-hour windows and can allow slots on days with no working-hours entry": 0.9603619575500488, "Date override check rejects a slot as soon as it finds any override on that day that the slot is outside of, which breaks days with multiple override ranges since a slot inside a later range can be rejected by an earlier non-matching range": 0.9425206184387207, "When any date override exists for the slot's day, checkIfIsAvailable can return true before evaluating busy times, which can allow booking a host during calendar-busy time as long as the slot is within the override window": 0.9414697885513306}